---
import "../style.css";
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#050505" />
  <meta name="description" content="Meet avocadoMini and avokadoPro. Each works on its own. Together they connect spatial input, games, and services through RockstarOS." />
  <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
  <meta property="og:title" content="avokado — Mini meets Pro" />
  <meta property="og:description" content="Two standalone products. One expanded experience." />
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://avocado-mini.kirin-999.chatgpt.site/" />
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary" />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://avocado-mini.kirin-999.chatgpt.site/" />
  <title>avokado — Mini meets Pro</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="/images/avokado-metallic-mark.png" type="image/png" />
</head>
<body class="ecosystem-page">
  <a class="skip" href="#products">Skip to products</a>
  <header class="site-header ecosystem-header">
    <a class="brand avokado-brand" href="/"><img class="avokado-brand-icon" src="/images/avokado-metallic-mark.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />avokado</a>
    <nav class="primary-nav" aria-label="Primary navigation">
      <a href="/mini/">avocadoMini</a>
      <a href="/pro/">avokadoPro</a>
      <a href="#together">Together</a>
      <a href="/install/">RockstarOS</a>
    </nav>
    <a class="header-cta" href="/preorder/">Current status <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="ecosystem-hero" aria-labelledby="ecosystem-title">
      <img src="/images/avocado-mini-tower20-e3-kit.png" alt="Four avocadoMini units arranged around a central avokadoPro Hub" fetchpriority="high" />
      <div class="ecosystem-hero-shade" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="ecosystem-hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">AVOCADOMINI × AVOKADOPRO</p>
        <h1 id="ecosystem-title">Two products.<br />One bigger world.</h1>
        <p>avocadoMini reads the space. avokadoPro runs games and services. Each works on its own. Together, they expand what the room can do.</p>
        <div class="ecosystem-actions">
          <a class="ecosystem-button is-light" href="/mini/">Explore avocadoMini <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <a class="ecosystem-button" href="/pro/">Explore avokadoPro <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="film-disclaimer"><strong>NEW SYSTEM</strong> Optional pairing. Products are sold separately.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="products" class="ecosystem-products" aria-labelledby="products-title">
      <div class="ecosystem-section-head">
        <p class="eyebrow">TWO STANDALONE PRODUCTS</p>
        <h2 id="products-title">Start with the product<br />that fits you.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="ecosystem-product-grid">
        <article class="ecosystem-product-card mini-card">
          <img src="/images/tower20-e3-front-transparent-v2.png" alt="Front view of avocadoMini Tower20 E3" loading="lazy" />
          <div>
            <span>SPATIAL INPUT</span>
            <h3>avocadoMini</h3>
            <p>Use one Mini on its own for local spatial experiences. Add more Minis later to expand range and experience quality.</p>
            <strong>From ¥160,000</strong>
            <a href="/mini/">View Mini <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="ecosystem-product-card pro-card">
          <img src="/images/tower20-e3-highlight-edge-hub-v1.png" alt="avokadoPro game Hub connected to avocadoMini units" loading="lazy" />
          <div>
            <span>GAME + SERVICES HUB</span>
            <h3>avokadoPro</h3>
            <p>Use Pro on its own for games and connected services. Add avocadoMini when you want spatial input and a larger play area.</p>
            <strong>From ¥880,000</strong>
            <a href="/pro/">View Pro <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="together" class="ecosystem-together" aria-labelledby="together-title">
      <img src="/images/tower20-e3-highlight-edge-hub-v1.png" alt="avokadoPro connecting to multiple avocadoMini units across a room" loading="lazy" />
      <div class="ecosystem-together-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">WHEN MINI MEETS PRO</p>
        <h2 id="together-title">The room<br />becomes the interface.</h2>
        <p>Mini contributes spatial viewpoints. Pro brings the game loop, local compute, storage, audio, and broader services. RockstarOS connects the system while keeping each product useful on its own.</p>
        <dl>
          <div><dt>Mini</dt><dd>Spatial input and expandable sensing coverage</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Pro</dt><dd>Standalone games, services, compute, and storage</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Together</dt><dd>Spatial play across a wider shared area</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <a class="ecosystem-button is-light" href="/install/">See RockstarOS <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ecosystem-choice" aria-labelledby="choice-title">
      <p class="eyebrow">CHOOSE YOUR STARTING POINT</p>
      <h2 id="choice-title">One system.<br />Your way in.</h2>
      <div>
        <a href="/mini/"><span>01 / AVOCADOMINI</span><strong>Explore spatial input</strong><em>From ¥160,000 ↗</em></a>
        <a href="/pro/"><span>02 / AVOKADOPRO</span><strong>Explore games and services</strong><em>From ¥880,000 ↗</em></a>
      </div>
      <p>Four-Mini reference package: ¥410,000. Products are sold separately. Reference prices exclude tax and shipping.</p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer><span>© 2026 avokadinc</span><a href="/mini/">avocadoMini</a><a href="/pro/">avokadoPro</a><a href="/rocket-star/">rocketstar</a><a href="/legal/">Sales disclosure</a><a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a></footer>
</body>
</html>
